## Interface: 16001, 11507, 11508, 11509
## Title: Kureq Utils
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Gear_01
## Notes: Small utilities: a ping macro for a mob or a quest's mobs, a nearby alert for them, and a key that deletes the cheapest bag item you allow, with loot worth more marked while your bags are full, kill stats: every mob you kill for experience, with graphs, maps and kill XP on tooltips (/ku stats), character notes: a star rating and a note on anyone, on their tooltip, and their invites blocked if you choose (/ku note), and loadouts: save your action bars, macros, key bindings and settings and load them on another character (/ku loadouts), macros: make and edit your macros, from ready-made ones for your class (/ku macro), and mail rules: send herbs, ore and other items to your other characters from the mailbox (/ku mail). /ku opens the settings.
## Author: Kureq
